    "This deletes your library backup from iCloud. Your other devices that sync use the same backup, so they won't get changes from it until one of them backs up again. Your library on this device isn't affected. If sync stays on, this device starts a new backup with its next change." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This deletes your library backup from iCloud. Your other devices that sync use the same backup, so they won't get changes from it until one of them backs up again. Your library on this device isn't affected. If sync stays on, this device starts a new backup with its next change."
          }
        }
      }
    },
